msgid "Instant Messenger"
msgstr "Messaedjreye sol moumint"

#: interfaces/kimproxy/interface/kcm_instantmessenger.desktop:75
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"The instant messenger allows two-way chat between individuals and groups."
